on you had.</p>
<p>I=E2=80=99m currently running the 27B dense model with dflash to see wha=
t different it makes to the speed (in theory the quality should be the same=
). I was surprised that in the benchmarks I=E2=80=99ve run, the dense model=
 hasn=E2=80=99t actually been as much slower as I=E2=80=99d expected (presu=
mably it=E2=80=99s more efficient and getting the answer and doesn=E2=80=99=
t go in loops or fail tool calls as often).</p><div class=3D"cooked-selecti=
